{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enigma Isle is a game <strong>in early developmen</strong>t where the player decides to live on a deserted island where the player can farm, forage, craft, fish and trade with seafarers.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Farm crops to cook meals to boost player stats and craft baits for fishing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121230/extras/cropGrow.gif?t=1740233828\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique FIshing!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121230/extras/fishing.gif?t=1740233828\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mine ores to upgrade your tools and weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your weapons to defend against pirates raids!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121230/extras/fightPirates.gif?t=1740233828\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3121230?t=1740233828","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3121230?t=1740233828","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121230/fb2db457bf53da89bd40f4198a7bde928d5fc344/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740233828","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121230/fb2db457bf53da89bd40f4198a7bde928d5fc344/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740233828","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enigma Isle is a game <strong>in early developmen</strong>t